384
00:18:45,220 --> 00:18:47,080
So that was the key idea.

385
00:18:47,080 --> 00:18:50,320
So it's a combination of
self-play with reinforcement

386
00:18:50,320 --> 00:18:51,920
learning and search.

387
00:18:51,920 --> 00:18:56,840
And essentially, the beauty
